// Molekula. Drawn from the Molekula2 switch positions in
// keyboards/Molekula2/production/positions.csv of
// https://github.com/opendata-nuernberg/molekula at
// 78ca099e9eb3d10618639eec493a3c0454c9b470 (MIT). Key indexes follow the
// firmware `pin_mappings` of my_keyboards/molekula/main.zig; each switch was
// matched through the PCB nets (switch column, diode row).
